# Summary :

<aside>
💡

Hunter is an easy challenge from HackSmarter, where we try to enumerate valid usernames on an enterprise portal. The portal seems pretty secure at first, as it doesn't return any information that could be used to filter for and enumerate users. However, the password reset feature has a flaw: the time it takes to process requests differs based on whether a user exists or not, so we will be abusing this to build a list of valid usernames. Basically, time-based user enumeration — if you want to call it that. :)

</aside>
